    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back in time on a mission from the Morse Gods, to prove that Morse is, and always will be, the ultimate method of communication. Compete against inferior forms of communication: horse, car, train, and a guy running really fast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transmit messages using authentic morse code.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against other forms of communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the skill of morse code while playing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">36 hand-made levels, designed to challenge you on speed, tactics and accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different maps: Ancient Arabia, Medieval England, 1850s USA, and Industrial England.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built-in level editor, and fan-made levels (using the Steam Workshop).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless modes, to test your skills even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selection of difficulties to increase your suffering.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back in time on a mission from the Morse Gods, to prove that Morse is, and always will be, the ultimate method of communication. Compete against inferior forms of communication: horse, car, train, and a guy running really fast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transmit messages using authentic morse code.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against other forms of communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the skill of morse code while playing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">36 hand-made levels, designed to challenge you on speed, tactics and accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different maps: Ancient Arabia, Medieval England, 1850s USA, and Industrial England.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built-in level editor, and fan-made levels (using the Steam Workshop).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless modes, to test your skills even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selection of difficulties to increase your suffering.</p></li></ul>",
